  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT\n\n### MTD IT - Bulk Authorisation\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 20 May, 2026 at 11:43 AM\n\n\t\tBulk Authorisation allows accountants to authorise multiple clients in a single action, helping save time and streamline the authorisation process.\n\n### \n\n### Step 1: Open the MTD IT Clients List\n\nNavigate to the MTD IT module and open the Clients page.\n\nYou will now see the new Agent Authorisation button available at the top of the client list.\n\nPlease Note:\nAs part of the agent authorisation, you will be required to complete the HMRC Identity verfication. \n\nStep 2: HMRC Authorisation Process\n\nOnce clicked on Bulk Authorise. You will be redirected to the HRMC authorisation page, select Continue\n\nClick Sign in to the HRMC Online services.\n\n### Complete HMRC Authorisation\n\n    Sign in using your Agent Services Account (ASA) credentials\n\n    Once signed in this will allow the software to connect with HRMC\n\n    Click Give permission.\n\nFor the next step, once you have signed up you have to prove your identity with HMRC providing the following information. \n\nHMRC Confirmation & Status Update\n\nOnce the authorisation is approved, HMRC will confirm the request. You will then be redirected back to Capium automatically.\n\n### \nStep 3: Select Multiple Clients\n\nUse the checkboxes on the left-hand side to select the clients you would like to authorise.\n\nOnce clients are selected, the Bulk Authorise option will become available at the bottom of the screen.\n\nThe client’s MTD IT status should update to Authorised.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201911\">MTD IT</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">MTD IT - Bulk Authorisation\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 20 May, 2026 at 11:43 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"155\" data-start=\"51\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Bulk Authorisation allows accountants to authorise multiple clients in a single action, helping save time and streamline the authorisation process.<br></span></p><h2 data-end=\"451\" data-section-id=\"hz94un\" data-start=\"419\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></h2><h3 data-end=\"493\" data-section-id=\"aw1g56\" data-start=\"453\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Step 1: Open the MTD IT Clients List</strong></span></span></h3><p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"495\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Navigate to the MTD IT module and open the Clients page.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"495\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You will now see the new Agent Authorisation button available at the top of the client list.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"659\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9248828210/original/cjiRByYfGqxB7imJy37DIjzf8ZhKX-HSuA.gif?1779273273\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9248828210\"></span></span></p><p data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"659\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"659\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Please Note:</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">As part of the agent authorisation, you will be required to complete the HMRC Identity verfication.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"659\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><