4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9246780500/original/Kg7y7KuRPLYJYWpfYQ0mQz8MGgn6pkuOTQ.png?1775657758\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9246780500\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">HMRC Confirmation &amp; Status Update</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Once the authorisation is approved, HMRC will confirm the request.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">You will then be redirected back to Capium automatically.</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9248828528/original/GsuLIiuYLNBvb32wS1w1lSbARosniiNpQg.png?1779273672\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9248828528\"></p><h3 data-end=\"758\" data-section-id=\"1kuwgy6\" data-start=\"723\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 3: Select Multiple Clients</strong></span></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"851\" data-start=\"760\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Use the checkboxes on the left-hand side to select the clients you would like to authorise.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"851\" data-start=\"760\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"853\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Once clients are selected, the Bulk Authorise option will become available at the bottom of the screen.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"853\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"853\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9248470171/original/VN704fSk1RGgOAxTdMWMnCN23utYkbRl8g.png?1778651743\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9248470171\"></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"962\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The client’s MTD IT status should update to Authorised.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9244933259/original/8jWcHK7MwfXT2yi71xwaq2PkgC2_DtlkeQ.png?1772210167\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9244933259\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></span></span></p><p data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"962\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000276525\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000276525/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000276525\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000276525/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-f